      "source": [
        "## 8. Membuat Fungsi Pembangun Model\n",
        "Fungsi ini membuat **pipeline** (preprocessing + Naive Bayes) sesuai fitur yang dipilih.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Fitur numerik dipakai apa adanya (`passthrough`) karena Naive Bayes tidak sensitif terhadap skala.\n",
        "- Fitur kategorik di-*one-hot encode* (`sparse_output=False` karena `GaussianNB` butuh data dense).\n",
        "- Pipeline selalu menerima DataFrame dengan nama kolom, sehingga mudah dipakai di web."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 8,
      "id": "40948f18",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "40948f18"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def buat_model(fitur_terpilih):\n",
        "    num = [f for f in fitur_terpilih if f in numerical_features]\n",
        "    cat = [f for f in fitur_terpilih if f in categorical_features]\n",
        "\n",
        "    transformers = []\n",
        "    if num:\n",
        "        transformers.append((\"num\", \"passthrough\", num))\n",
        "    if cat:\n",
        "        transformers.append((\"cat\", OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\"ignore\", sparse_output=False), cat))\n",
        "\n",
        "    preprocessor = ColumnTransformer(transformers=transformers)\n",
        "\n",
        "    return Pipeline([\n",
        "        (\"preprocessing\", preprocessor),\n",
        "        (\"naive_bayes\", GaussianNB()),\n",
        "    ])"
      ]
    },
