      "source": [
        "## 15. Menyimpan Model Terbaik untuk Web\n",
        "Yang disimpan adalah **satu file `.joblib`** berisi:\n",
        "- `model` : pipeline lengkap (preprocessing + Naive Bayes)\n",
        "- daftar fitur numerik & kategorik yang dipakai\n",
        "- opsi kategori dan rentang nilai numerik (agar form web dibuat otomatis)\n",
        "- metrik evaluasi model\n",
        "\n",
        "Dengan begitu aplikasi web tidak perlu menulis ulang preprocessing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 15,
      "id": "d0d25d83",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "d0d25d83",
        "outputId": "c3ca39a9-c5aa-4fdd-963a-ccaf63fdc9a3"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Model tersimpan sebagai: model_naive_bayes_jantung.joblib\n",
            "\n",
            "Informasi form web yang akan dibuat:\n",
            "Numerik  : {\n",
            "  \"Oldpeak\": {\n",
            "    \"min\": -2.6,\n",
            "    \"max\": 5.6,\n",
            "    \"median\": 0.5,\n",
            "    \"integer\": false\n",
            "  },\n",
            "  \"Cholesterol\": {\n",
            "    \"min\": 0.0,\n",
            "    \"max\": 603.0,\n",
            "    \"median\": 225.0,\n",
            "    \"integer\": true\n",
            "  },\n",
            "  \"MaxHR\": {\n",
            "    \"min\": 60.0,\n",
            "    \"max\": 202.0,\n",
            "    \"median\": 138.0,\n",
            "    \"integer\": true\n",
            "  },\n",
            "  \"FastingBS\": {\n",
            "    \"min\": 0.0,\n",
            "    \"max\": 1.0,\n",
            "    \"median\": 0.0,\n",
            "    \"integer\": true\n",
            "  }\n",
            "}\n",
            "Kategorik: {\n",
            "  \"ST_Slope\": [\n",
            "    \"Down\",\n",
            "    \"Flat\",\n",
            "    \"Up\"\n",
            "  ],\n",
            "  \"ChestPainType\": [\n",
            "    \"ASY\",\n",
            "    \"ATA\",\n",
            "    \"NAP\",\n",
            "    \"TA\"\n",
            "  ],\n",
            "  \"ExerciseAngina\": [\n",
            "    \"N\",\n",
            "    \"Y\"\n",
            "  ],\n",
            "  \"Sex\": [\n",
            "    \"F\",\n",
            "    \"M\"\n",
            "  ]\n",
            "}\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num_dipakai = [f for f in fitur_terbaik if f in numerical_features]\n",
        "cat_dipakai = [f for f in fitur_terbaik if f in categorical_features]\n",
        "\n",
        "rentang_numerik = {}\n",
        "for f in num_dipakai:\n",
        "    seri = X_train[f]\n",
        "    rentang_numerik[f] = {\n",
        "        \"min\": float(seri.min()),\n",
        "        \"max\": float(seri.max()),\n",
        "        \"median\": float(seri.median()),\n",
        "        \"integer\": bool((seri % 1 == 0).all()),\n",
        "    }\n",
        "\n",
        "opsi_kategori = {f: sorted(X_train[f].dropna().unique().tolist()) for f in cat_dipakai}\n",
        "\n",
        "bundle = {\n",
        "    \"model\": model_terbaik,\n",
        "    \"nama_skenario\": nama_terbaik,\n",
        "    \"fitur\": fitur_terbaik,\n",
        "    \"numerical_features\": num_dipakai,\n",
        "    \"categorical_features\": cat_dipakai,\n",
        "    \"rentang_numerik\": rentang_numerik,\n",
        "    \"opsi_kategori\": opsi_kategori,\n",
        "    \"label\": {0: \"Tidak Sakit\", 1: \"Sakit\"},\n",
        "    \"metrik\": {\n",
        "        \"accuracy\": float(terbaik[\"Accuracy\"]),\n",
        "        \"precision\": float(terbaik[\"Precision\"]),\n",
        "        \"recall\": float(terbaik[\"Recall\"]),\n",
        "        \"f1\": float(terbaik[\"F1-Score\"]),\n",
        "    },\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "NAMA_FILE_MODEL = \"model_naive_bayes_jantung.joblib\"\n",
        "joblib.dump(bundle, NAMA_FILE_MODEL)\n",
        "print(f\"Model tersimpan sebagai: {NAMA_FILE_MODEL}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nInformasi form web yang akan dibuat:\")\n",
        "print(\"Numerik  :\", json.dumps(rentang_numerik, indent=2))\n",
        "print(\"Kategorik:\", json.dumps(opsi_kategori, indent=2))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
